sentences.text:
Let the applicant Munjarin involved in Case Crime No. 221 of 2022, under Sections 498A, 323, 504,
376 IPC and Section 3/4 D.P. Act, Police Station Babari, District Shamli, be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions;
(i) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that he shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence when the witnesses are present in court.

